     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Comment from Sourceforge Task&#93;</span><br/>\nComment Submitter: cwilper<br/>\nCommitted to maintenance-2.2 r6546.<br/>\nThis fixes the following bugs:<br/>\n 1720485: Null pointer running v2.2 installer<br/>\n     TomcatServerXML now throws InstallationFailedException if XPath queries fail.<br/>\n     Also added a (rudimentary) JUnit test case.<br/>\n 1747186: FedoraAccessServlet hardcodes tiny buffer for datastreams.<br/>\n     Set a 4KB buffer.<br/>\n 1816735: Flush and close missing in FieldSearchServlet<br/>\n...and partially addresses the following bug:<br/>\n 1853905: Installer fails if FEDORA_HOME contains a space.</p>",
     "created": "06/Feb/08 5:10 PM",
     "id": "10629",
